    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A proof-theoretic approach to uniform interpolation property of multi-<span class="search-hit mathjax">agent</span> modal logic
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Su%2C+Y">Youan Su</a>
      
